From bates at stat.wisc.edu  Thu Jun 25 15:31:03 1998
From: bates at stat.wisc.edu (Douglas Bates)
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 1998 10:31:03 -0500
Subject: Re: [S] SE's for ratio of two parameters
